      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::webcard",
        "PMC5818523::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting material contains relatively coarse internal lamellar boundaries.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dislocation pile-ups at the starting material's internal boundaries produce local stress concentrations, microcracking, and premature failure.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast or conventionally cold-rolled and annealed alloy has limited room-temperature tensile ductility and is brittle.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryogenic rolling followed by annealing is an effective thermo-mechanical processing route for AlCoCrFeNi2.1.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5818523::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryogenic rolling and annealing produce a refined hierarchical nano-lamellar microstructure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5818523::webcard",
        "PMC6353877::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention reduces lamellar spacing relative to the untreated alloy.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5818523::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention reduces misorientation at internal boundaries.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed microstructure contains ultrafine grains within FCC lamellae.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5818523::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processing stabilizes the B2 phase.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5818523::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryogenic deformation creates heterogeneous strain partitioning among the constituent phases.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5818523::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent annealing promotes ultrafine-grain formation and partial recrystallization.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5818523::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refined microstructure distributes dislocations more uniformly.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refined microstructure minimizes dislocation pile-ups at phase interfaces and consequently reduces local stress concentration and crack nucleation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryogenic rolling and annealing increase elongation to failure relative to both as-cast and cold-rolled-and-annealed AlCoCrFeNi2.1.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5818523::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryogenic rolling and annealing maintain or increase yield strength and ultimate tensile strength relative to the untreated alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5818523::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
